   579	Toy endogeneity test: d = 3, 44-bit balanced semiprimes (seeds 1–12), M = 2^{20}, B = 2^{10}, Y = 2^{14}, S = 32,
   580	400 parent nodes per instance (rational ℓ ≈ 2^{22}, first box point with Y-smooth cofactors). D1 = one-step

